\b --------- X-Path using CSSSelectors ------------\b0\par
\par
1. Basic Selectors\par
------------------\par
CSS: tagname\par
CSS: 'div'\par
XPath: //tagname\par
\par
2. Class Selectors\par
-------------------\par
CSS: .classname\par
CSS: '.example'\par
XPath: //tagname[contains(@class, 'classname')]\par
\par
3. ID Selectors\par
------------------\par
CSS: #id\par
CSS:'#unique'\par
XPath: //tagname[@id='id']\par
\par
4. Attribute Selectors\par
------------------------\par
CSS: [attribute='value']\par
CSS:'input[type='text']'\par
XPath: //tagname[@attribute='value']\par
\par
5. Child Selectors\par
-----------------------\par
CSS: parent > child\par
CSS:'div > p'\par
XPath: //parent/child\par
\par
6. Descendant Selectors\par
--------------------------\par
CSS: ancestor descendant\par
CSS:'div p'\par
XPath: //ancestor//descendant\par
\par
7. Sibling Selectors\par
-----------------------\par
CSS: previous + next\par
XPath: //previous/following-sibling::*[1][self::next]\par
\par
8. Nth-child Selectors\par
--------------------------\par
CSS: :nth-child(n)\par
CSS: 'div:nth-child(2)\par
XPath: //tagname[position()=n]\par
